# Sources of the study r1/web-jit-and-performance. Web pages were read through a summarising fetch tool.

n: 2.12
name: sources-self-compiling-systems
kind: hub
is: Sources of the first-round web study of JIT compilation, small self-hosting systems, images and host efficiency: the study report itself, 41 public pages and papers fetched on 2026-11-24 through a summarising fetch tool, and one file of the old body.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/web-jit-and-performance

n: 2.12.1
name: web-jit-and-performance.md
kind: source
is: The study report: bootstrapping a small system to the hardware's full efficiency, 573 lines, with a table of 64 web sources and 3 local ones. Its local commands (sysctl, sw_vers, compiler versions, the powermetrics manual) are recorded in it.
path: coherence-seed/study/r1/web-jit-and-performance.md
date: 2026-11-24
got: 2026-11-24
at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/web-jit-and-performance

